        "narration": "Hundreds of skulls in this frozen lake had matching round holes. Deep in the Himalayas, Lake Roopkund hid hundreds of skeletons frozen in ice.",
        "visual_keywords": "frozen lake snow mountains"
      },
      {
        "narration": "At sixteen thousand feet, no roads existed. For decades, people assumed a lost army perished here.",
        "visual_keywords": "snowy mountain peak mist"
